    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Peperomiaprostrata(407TC)(1)/31444",
      "html": "<p>Peperomia prostrata, better known as String of Turtles, is a highly sought-after terrarium plant that is now available in vitro for the first time globally. Its small, round leaves feature a striking pattern reminiscent of miniature turtle shells, combining light green markings with rich brown tones to create a truly unique appearance.</p><p>This versatile species can be used in many ways within a terrarium. It readily creeps across the substrate as a decorative carpet, climbs humid backgrounds, or cascades elegantly from wood and hardscape features. Its compact growth and distinctive foliage make it an eye-catching addition to both small and large tropical setups.</p>"
    }
